       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-DIFFUSION-LLM-FUSION.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DIFFUSION-LLM-PIPELINE.
           05  WS-UNET-CONV2D-RESNET-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CROSS-ATTN-DEEPSEEK-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MOONDREAMS-VISION-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-VAE-LATENT-BIJECTIVE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DDIM-NOISE-REVERSAL-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DIFFUSION-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DIFFUSION-PROVEN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-FUSION-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-UNET-AND-CROSS-ATTN.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-VISION-AND-LATENTS.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-DENOISING-SCHEDULE.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-DIFFUSION-FUSION.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-UNET-AND-CROSS-ATTN.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UNET-CONV2D-RESNET-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CROSS-ATTN-DEEPSEEK-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-VISION-AND-LATENTS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOONDREAMS-VISION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VAE-LATENT-BIJECTIVE-OK.
       3000-EVALUATE-DENOISING-SCHEDULE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DDIM-NOISE-REVERSAL-OK.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-DIFFUSION-FUSION.
           IF WS-UNET-CONV2D-RESNET-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CROSS-ATTN-DEEPSEEK-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MOONDREAMS-VISION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-VAE-LATENT-BIJECTIVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DDIM-NOISE-REVERSAL-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DIFFUSION-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-FUSION-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DIFFUSION-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-FUSION-CODE.
